      "source": "Creates an <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of name to value tuples.",
