    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> from the current instance and sets the value from <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a>. Existing key\ndefinitions for <code>name</code> are overwritten if they already exist.",
      "translation": "从当前实例创建一个新的<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>，并设置来自<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>的值。如果已存在名为<code>name</code>的键定义，则将其覆盖。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Represents an operation that accepts identifier key parts (name, value and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>target type</code></a>) defining a\ncontract to consume <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> values.",
      "translation": "表示一种操作，它接受标识符键部分（名称、值以及<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>目标类型</code></a>），这些部分定义了一个用于消费 <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> 值的契约。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> from the current instance and sets the value from <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从当前实例创建一个新的<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>，并设置来自<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> from the current instance and sets the value for <code>key</code>. Existing key\ndefinitions for <code>name</code> are overwritten if they already exist.",
      "translation": "从当前实例创建一个新的<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a>，并为<code>key</code>设置值。如果已存在针对<code>name</code>的键定义，则会被覆盖。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> from the current instance and sets the value for <code>key</code>.",
      "translation": "从当前实例创建一个新的<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>，并设置<code>key</code>的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs the given action for each element of the <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> until all elements have been processed or the\naction throws an exception.",
      "translation": "对<a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert 中的类\"><code>Identifier</code></a>的每个元素执行给定操作，直到所有元素都被处理或操作抛出异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs the given action for each element of the <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> until all elements have been processed or the\naction throws an exception. Unless otherwise specified by the implementing class, actions are performed in the\norder of iteration (if an iteration order is specified). Exceptions thrown by the action are relayed to the caller.",
      "translation": "对 <a href=\"Identifier.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>Identifier</code></a> 的每个元素执行给定操作，直到所有元素都被处理或操作抛出异常。除非实现类另有规定，否则操作按迭代顺序（如果指定了迭代顺序）执行。操作抛出的异常将传递给调用者。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Identifier represents a composite id of an entity that may be composed of one or many parts. Parts or all\nof the entity might not have a representation as a property in the entity but might only be derived from other\nentities referencing it.",
      "translation": "标识符表示实体的复合 ID，该实体可能由一个或多个部分组成。实体的部分或全部可能不作为实体的属性存在，而仅通过引用该实体的其他实体推导得出。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
